### How to Run

1.  Save all the files in their respective locations.
2.  Open your terminal in the `redux-example-app` directory.
3.  Run `npm start` (or `yarn start`).

You should see the application running in your browser, initially showing "Loading posts..." for a second, then displaying the fetched posts. You can add new posts and react to existing ones, observing the state changes in real-time.

